Limitations
- This is a deterministic synthetic reference correctness workload, not a claim about unlabelled real-user conversations.
- Runtime lanes validate provider-neutral formatting and semantic consistency without invoking an external model; naturalness still needs the RFC human acceptability set.
- M17 owns official concurrent-server throughput, memory ceilings, and hardware-normalized performance certification.
